      hu: "Közvetlenül a Nyeman partján álló vár fontos stratégiai pont volt. Ma önkéntesek restaurálják, hogy visszaállítsák a reneszánsz épület egykori fényét.",
      ro: "Situat chiar pe malul râului Neman, acest castel a fost un punct strategic important. Astăzi este restaurat de voluntari pentru a reda strălucirea renescentistă.",
      en: "Located directly on the banks of the Neman river, this castle was an important strategic point. Today it is being restored by volunteers to regain its Renaissance glory.",
