      de: ["Site of the 13th-century capital of the Grand Duchy of Lithuania", "Grand Duke Mindaugas was crowned King of Lithuania here in 1253", "Originally defended by seven large stone and brick towers", "The hill rises 323 meters above sea level", "Destroyed by Swedish forces during the Great Northern War in 1706", "The ruins of the Shield and Kostel towers remain visible today", "A major site for annual medieval festivals and jousting tournaments"],
